      "amount": "1 tsp",
      "notes": "enhance flavors"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fresh thyme",
      "amount": "1 tsp",
      "notes": "aromatic herb, add depth"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Fry the chopped onions and garlic in olive oil until caramelized.",
    "Add the chopped mushrooms and bell peppers, fry until crispy.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix the monsoon French bread, vegan white wine vinegar, nutritional yeast, and salt.",
    "Pour the bread mixture into a baking dish and top with the fried vegetables.",
    "Drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle with fresh thyme.",
    "Cover the dish with aluminum foil and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the foil and bake for an additional 15 minutes, until golden brown.",
    "Let it rest for 5 minutes before serving."
